Appendix F: Proof of Theorem 5.3 (General Monotone Symmetric Norm)

Theorem F.1 (Main approximation, conditional on Lemma 5.1). For every monotone symmetric norm f,

f(\mathbf{d}^{\mathrm{ALG}}) \le (3+O(\varepsilon)) f(\mathbf{d}^*).

Proof. By Lemma A.1, write

f(\mathbf{x}) = \sum_{\ell=1}^{n} c_\ell \|\mathbf{x}\|_{\text{top-}\ell}

with c_\ell = w_\ell - w_{\ell+1} \ge 0. Applying Theorem E.1 to each top-\ell term and summing,

f(\mathbf{d}^{\mathrm{ALG}}) = \sum_{\ell=1}^{n} c_\ell \|\mathbf{d}^{\mathrm{ALG}}\|_{\text{top-}\ell} \le \sum_{\ell=1}^{n} c_\ell (3+O(\varepsilon)) \|\mathbf{d}^*\|_{\text{top-}\ell} = (3+O(\varepsilon)) f(\mathbf{d}^*).

\square

